---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Salvatore Di Dio — Researcher, designer, social entrepreneur"
description: "Associate Professor of Design at the University of Palermo. I design for the gap between what people know about the climate and what they actually do."
---

<section class="claim">
  <h1>Cities change when the people change.</h1>
  <p class="subclaim">How to design for better behaviour, leaner cities and a future by design, not by disaster.</p>
  <p class="tagline">
    <strong>Researcher &middot; Designer &middot; Social entrepreneur</strong><br>
    <span>Associate Professor of Design &mdash; University of Palermo</span>
  </p>

  {% include "partials/slider.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="bridge">
  <p>Since 2010, with scholars, practitioners and professionals across multiple countries, I have been
     asking the same question in different settings: why do people who recognise the climate
     emergency still behave as if it were not happening? It is called the
     attitude&ndash;behaviour gap, and trying to close it is what I design for.</p>
  <p>At the <a href="{{ site.unipa }}">University of Palermo</a> I study it. With <a href="https://www.wepush.org/">PUSH</a> we
     test it in real environments. With <a href="https://www.muvgame.com/">MUV</a> we turned it
     into a platform that measures what happens. With
     <a href="https://www.piranesiexperience.com/">Piranesi</a> we tell it to people who will
     never read a paper.</p>
  <p class="coda">Four instruments, one line of research.</p>
</section>

<section class="now" aria-labelledby="h-now">
  <h2 id="h-now">Now</h2>
  <ul>
    {%- for item in now.items %}
    <li>{{ item.text | safe }}<span class="when">{{ item.when }}</span></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="updated">Updated {{ now.updated | readableDate }}</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="h-projects">
  <h2 id="h-projects">Active projects</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    {%- for p in projects %}
    <article class="card">
      <h3>{% if p.url %}<a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ p.name }}{% endif %}</h3>
      {% if p.when %}<span class="when">{{ p.when }}</span>{% endif %}
      <p>{{ p.text | safe }}{% if p.todo %} {% todo p.todo %}{% endif %}</p>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="oneline" aria-labelledby="h-research">
  <h2 id="h-research">Research</h2>
  <p>Over 50 publications on design, behaviour and urban sustainability, in journals
     including <cite>Sustainable Cities and Society</cite>, <cite>Sustainability</cite>,
     <cite>Heliyon</cite> and <cite>Energies</cite>.</p>
  <ul class="links">
    <li><a href="https://orcid.org/{{ site.orcid }}">ORCID</a></li>
{%- if site.scholar %}
    <li><a href="{{ site.scholar }}">Google Scholar</a></li>
{%- endif %}
{%- if "/research/" | hasPage(collections.all) %}
    <li><a href="/research/">All research</a></li>
{%- endif %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="h-talk">
  <h2 id="h-talk">Talks and interviews</h2>

  <!-- Degrades to a plain link with JavaScript off. The script upgrades it into a
       click-to-load embed, so nobody pays 500 KB for a video they never play. -->
  <a class="facade" id="talk" href="{{ talks.featured.url }}" data-embed="{{ talks.featured.youtube }}">
    <span class="cap">
      <strong lang="{{ talks.featured.lang }}">{{ talks.featured.title }}</strong><br>
      {{ talks.featured.event }}, {{ talks.featured.year }}
      <span class="play">Watch the talk &rarr;</span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <p class="facade-note">The player loads from YouTube only when you click: from then on Google
     receives your IP address.{% if "/privacy/" | hasPage(collections.all) %} <a href="/privacy/#video">More in the privacy page</a>.{% endif %}</p>

  <div class="scroll-x" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Table, scrolls sideways on small screens">
    <table class="data">
      <caption class="visually-hidden">Other talks and interviews</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Title</th><th scope="col">Where</th><th scope="col">Year</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- for t in talks.talks %}
        <tr>
          <td><a href="{{ t.url }}"{% if t.lang %} lang="{{ t.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ t.title }}</a></td>
          <td>{{ t.where }}</td>
          <td class="num">{{ t.year }}</td>
        </tr>
        {%- endfor %}
        {%- for t in talks.appearances %}
        <tr>
          <td><a href="{{ t.url }}"{% if t.lang %} lang="{{ t.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ t.title }}</a></td>
          <td>{{ t.where }}</td>
          <td class="num">{{ t.year or "&mdash;" | safe }}</td>
        </tr>
        {%- endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {%- if "/talks/" | hasPage(collections.all) %}
  <p><a href="/talks/">All talks and interviews</a></p>
  {%- endif %}
</section>

<section class="contact" aria-labelledby="h-contact">
  <h2 id="h-contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>I answer my own email &mdash; there is no press office. To invite me to speak, to discuss a
     thesis, to propose a collaboration: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
</section>

